---
import dashboard from '../../../../docs/brand/screenshots/seleccionadas/01-dashboard.png'
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 text-white">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_15%_20%,rgba(37,99,235,.32),transparent_34%),radial-gradient(circle_at_82%_24%,rgba(22,163,74,.22),transparent_28%)]"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.035]" style="background-image:linear-gradient(white 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,white 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:42px 42px"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto grid min-w-0 max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-14 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:py-28">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90 backdrop-blur"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Diseñado para la realidad educativa del Ecuador</span>
      <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.06] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Menos gestión.<br /><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Más educación.</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Auleka conecta notas, asistencia, matrícula, DECE, reportes y familias en una sola plataforma. Tu equipo trabaja con claridad y cada estudiante recibe seguimiento oportuno.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="#demo" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-blue-50">Solicitar una demo <span class="ml-2">→</span></a>
        <a href="#plataforma" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur transition hover:bg-white/10">Explorar la plataforma</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><b class="text-emerald-400">✓</b> Implementación acompañada</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><b class="text-emerald-400">✓</b> Soporte local</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><b class="text-emerald-400">✓</b> Sin compromiso</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-float relative min-w-0 lg:translate-x-6">
      <div class="absolute -inset-5 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500/20 to-emerald-500/20 blur-2xl"></div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-2 shadow-2xl shadow-black/40 backdrop-blur">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2"><div class="flex gap-1.5"><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span></div><span class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-white/50">Vista real de Auleka</span></div>
        <img src={dashboard.src} alt="Dashboard de gestión educativa de Auleka" class="w-full rounded-xl bg-white" loading="eager" />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-5 left-5 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-slate-900/95 px-4 py-3 shadow-xl backdrop-blur sm:left-auto sm:right-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">La institución completa, en una sola vista</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">Información útil para decidir a tiempo</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
